<LegalLayout title="Return and refund policy" eyebrow="Made-to-order purchases" description="What happens when an order is cancelled, damaged, incorrect or does not meet the approved specification.">
  <h2>Personalised products</h2>
  <p>Because each printed book is made for one child, we cannot accept change-of-mind returns after production begins. Please review all spelling, personalisation and delivery details before approving the preview.</p>

  <h2>Cancellations</h2>
  <p>You may request cancellation before final preview approval and production. Once production has started, cancellation may not be possible because the product cannot be resold.</p>

  <h2>Damaged, defective or incorrect orders</h2>
  <p>If your book arrives damaged, has a manufacturing defect or differs materially from the approved preview, contact us within 30 days of delivery. Include the order reference and clear photos. After verification, we will arrange a replacement, reprint or refund as appropriate.</p>

  <h2>Digital editions</h2>
  <p>Digital editions cannot normally be returned after delivery. If the file is corrupt, incomplete or materially different from the approved version, we will correct or replace it.</p>

  <h2>Refund timing</h2>
  <p>Approved refunds are sent to the original payment method. Banks and payment providers may take 7–10 business days to reflect the credit.</p>

  <h2>Request support</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@bookmojo.in">hello@bookmojo.in</a> with your order reference and details of the issue.</p>
</LegalLayout>